Files derived from the Incus project
------------------------------------

The following files are generated by hack/sync-incus-agent.sh from the
Incus project, https://github.com/lxc/incus, which is licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://github.com/lxc/incus/blob/main/COPYING),
at the release and commit pinned in images/incus-support/incus-agent.pin.
Each file carries a header naming its origin, the release and the commit.
They differ from upstream only in that header and, where the file has it,
upstream's TARGET placeholder resolved to /usr/lib.

  images/incus-support/systemd/usr/lib/systemd/incus-agent-setup
  images/incus-support/openrc/usr/local/bin/incus-agent-setup
      from internal/server/instance/drivers/agent-loader/incus-agent-setup-linux
  images/incus-support/systemd/usr/lib/systemd/system/incus-agent.service
      from internal/server/instance/drivers/agent-loader/systemd/incus-agent.service
  images/incus-support/systemd/usr/lib/udev/rules.d/99-incus-agent.rules
      from internal/server/instance/drivers/agent-loader/systemd/incus-agent.rules

Files modelled on distrobuilder
-------------------------------

The two OpenRC services of the incus-support image,
images/incus-support/openrc/etc/init.d/incus-agent and
images/incus-support/openrc/etc/init.d/incus-agent-setup, are modelled on
the OpenRC services that distrobuilder (https://github.com/lxc/distrobuilder,
Apache License, Version 2.0) generates for the agent, in
generators/incus-agent.go at commit
20b6d66. Their header comments list the differences.
